SUMMARY:Duvall City Council Meeting (City of Duvall)
LOCATION:Please visit the agenda center to view the meeting agenda. The agenda for all our meetings is available HERE . Meetings take place at the Duvall Visitor Center. Meeting locations may change. To see where the meeting will be held\, please review the meeting agenda. The meeting location will be at the top of the first page. You may also attend the meeting virtually. The agenda includes the login information on the last page. Meetings are also live-streamed via Zoom . Meeting recordings are available the day after the meeting. You can watch this and previous meetings on our YouTube&nbsp\; channel. For more information about the meetings\, please visit our website . - 15619 Main Street\, NE Duvall WA 98019
